> /dev/rtc to change
> ...got clock tick
> Time read from Hardware Clock: 1970/01/09 21:28:28
> Hw clock time : 1970/01/09 21:28:28 = 786508 seconds since 1969
> Fri Jan  9 21:28:28 1970  -0.188839 seconds
>
